# Build a desk widget
@scenario office_lesson_25
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk wave]
pip: See the little light in the corner of the project board? The lamp and the board are separate entities.
pip: Open the JES scene and select the lamp. Change its fill and leave the board untouched.
@label check
pip: Which change should affect just the lamp?
> Edit the named lamp entity. -> correct
> Tint the entire stage. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Separate entities give the editor independent targets. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Separate entities give the editor independent targets.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_25]
[flag tutorial_done_25]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
